- The starter dataset contains 30,000 content pages and multiple measurable performance-related features.
- Search volume has almost no linear correlation with 90-day impressions in the complete starter dataset.
- Average CTR differs across search position tiers in my filtered sample.
- Content age, update history, search visibility and engagement are useful signals to investigate when studying content-review opportunities.
