### What I Cannot Claim

- I cannot claim that updating a page will automatically increase its traffic, CTR or search ranking.
- I cannot establish causation from the correlations or group comparisons in my exploratory analysis.
- I cannot assume that every old page or declining page needs a content refresh.
- I cannot claim that my model predicts Google's internal ranking algorithm.
- I cannot claim that the starter model's current-window declining label represents a future decline or proves that a refresh would be beneficial.

### Limitations and Future Validation

The starter dataset provides a useful environment for exploring relationships between content characteristics and historical performance.

